# Claude Code settings. Neither file is committed.
#
# app_location is "/" on all four workflows, so the repo root IS the deployed
# site, and staticwebapp.config.json gates only /, /*.html and /api/*.
# Verified against production: GET /.claude/settings.json returned 200 with the
# file's contents, unauthenticated, on both instances. Not credentials, but it
# lists internal paths, resource group and database names, and the shape of our
# tooling -- none of which belongs on a public URL.
.claude/

